{"server":"tw","storyId":"act40side_level_act40side_07_beg","groupId":"act40side","stageId":"act40side_07","title":"五省盤","storyCode":"OR-7","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"c80ecd1831bee4f541f02f414095d8f4bf0b668439d0be846182ab2becdd6b11","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g14_yanprison"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真是命大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在大理寺待了這麼多年，進了死獄還有機會活著出來的，你是頭一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這樣的結果，在下自己也沒想到就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你們這些吃墨水的，就是有這個臭毛病。做事只為了一口氣，不考慮後果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"查了這麼久的案子，這麼多年的心血，就換來百珍宴上送上的一道菜，換來一個龍顏大怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鬧這麼一齣，落得這個下場，你就滿意了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虞兄教訓得是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可在下所作所為，於忠於義，都問心無愧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"窺見淵鱗者為大不祥，還真是不祥……接下來你如何打算？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"調令已經下來，三天後隨外交使團，前往維多利亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此事過後，我再無可能留在百灶。這樣的安排，也是尚書大人爭取來的結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞？你這副身子，如何撐得過那段路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒙恩逢赦，夫復何求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何況此次去維多利亞，我也算回家了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那還能算是家嗎？我記得你說，你的妻女都已經亡故了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……很多年前的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你覺得就算我信了你這句話，其他人會信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能記得當年的事，自然也會有別人記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次回去，你知道會有多少雙眼睛盯著你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該怎麼做……還請虞兄明示。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"借先生人命一用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要的清白真相，我給你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g7_forbiddencity"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g7_forbiddencity"},{"type":"narration","text":"我第一次來到百灶求學時，印象最深的，是遮天蔽日的高樓和望不到頭的萬家燈火。\n而那燈火的中央，就是禁城。\n危樓千尺，高聳入雲，目不能視。\n老師說，這裡進行的每一項決策、下達的每一道政令，都會影響萬千百姓的生計。責任之重，重於山嶽。\n也因此，這裡應當是每個學子，一生才學得以施展的地方。\n為天地立心，為生民立命。\n然而，當我真的站在這裡，面對這瓊樓玉宇、深宮高牆——\n我感到令人透不過氣的寒意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g7_forbiddencity"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人來得真早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寧小姐……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？梁大人看起來好像很驚訝，是不樂意見到我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎會……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是沒有聽說，寧小姐也要來參加百珍宴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尚書大人身體抱恙，今年禮部只好由我代他出席了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是臨時的決定，沒有來得及告訴梁大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過梁大人赴宴的事，好像也沒有打算告訴我啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只當是公事……便沒有煩擾寧小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"突然想起，尚蜀一別，和梁大人也已有大半年未見。這期間，我們書信都沒有通過幾次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"書信難通，又耽於公務，確實疏於聯絡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寧小姐怪罪，我無可辯駁……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡會責怪梁大人呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人擔任知府時，心中就放不下家鄉的一草一木。如今職責有變，要操心的事只會更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是不知怎麼，只是過了半年，就覺得和梁大人之間好像又變得生分了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些話，也說不出口了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，梁大人應該是第一次參加這百珍宴吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是……早年在尚蜀為官，與這等政務自是少有交集。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歷年百珍宴上，往往都是有一些大事要商定的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知今年，這場兵戈之事，陛下會如何決斷呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁某不敢對上意妄加揣測。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但梁大人是聰明人，總是能猜對的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那日，梁大人其實是有事，想要找祖父他商議的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……在下不敢欺瞞寧小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼說，你願意來見我，我總是開心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但恐怕對於梁大人來說，我始終不是可以信賴和託付的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寧小姐，應該是誤會了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有責怪梁大人的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當初披上這身紅袍，誰不厭惡這些官場陰私？可又不得不做些曲意周旋之事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寧某雖未身處朝局的中央，但也明白了一個道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說真話難，讓別人相信你說的是真話，更難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"入了這道宮牆，“真心”兩字，是最站不住腳的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可梁某人，對寧小姐，總是真心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論將來發生何事，在下總希望，寧小姐記得——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧辭秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人，該入席了。我們進去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g10_restaurantkitchen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"資深廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快點快點！最後再確認一遍食材！客人都已經入席了，等命令一下，就要上菜了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"資深廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再清點一遍所有食材，檢查一下燉菜和湯的狀態！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的年輕廚師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"九十號灶上的“福壽全”，不知道怎麼的，湯的顏色看起來就是差一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"資深廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼搞的？說了多少遍，切成一寸見方的塊，一點都不能多；十個時辰的火候，一點也不能斷！肯定又是哪個步驟馬虎了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"資深廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……！放著放著，我過去看看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）喂喂……這裡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼還穿著這身衣服！是生怕別人注意不到你，還是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出席正式場合，當然要著正裝……這一套還是我留在家裡備用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可這裡是廚房！你就沒有更適合這裡一點的衣服？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們大理寺的調查員，易容打扮什麼的不該是基本功嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這都是什麼歪理，大理寺少卿又不是什麼見不得光的身分——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是最近這陣子，不知道為什麼總在做些偷偷摸摸的事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別廢話了，這套衣服給你。一會你就跟著上菜的隊伍混進宴會現場，到時候你再換上你這身袍子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……混進這樣的場合，還真是有點緊張……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說一會你站出來伸冤，萬一惹得真龍大怒，他會不會直接把你抓起來，甚至……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"百珍宴向來有進諫獻言的傳統，何況我們只是要求重審一件證據不齊的舊案，真龍又何必遷怒於我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是有一件事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有沒有想過，萬一……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萬一，我們將這件案子查到最後，得到的真相和我們想的截然不同……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萬一……你發現，你周圍的一切，都是一個巨大的謊言……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這又是什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們做了這麼多事，不就是為了查到一個真相？是謊言就戳破它，還有什麼可猶豫的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都已經走到這一步了，我們還有什麼選擇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌……我覺得，你的父親他，應該是個好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？幹嘛突然說這個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"答應我，一會要是發生了什麼意外，一定先保護好自——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓，別說了！來人了，先躲起來！灶台下面！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都準備好了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"準……準備好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你負責的這碗長壽麵，雖然簡單，卻也是至關重要的一道菜，不能有一點差錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明……明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我不知道你的師父為什麼不願意來百珍宴，但我相信他挑中你，總歸有他的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次宴席辦完後，我給你一個機會，來接我的衣缽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不樂意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈……能當您的徒弟，應該有不少廚師做夢都會笑醒吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我不明白，為什麼您一定要將畢生手藝只傳於一人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荒唐……你可知這鼎豐樓每一任總廚，挑選徒弟要經過多少道考核？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遠的不說，我師父編《食經》，整理四大菜系菜譜，經手了幾十年的百珍宴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這鼎豐樓廚房，數百個同樣跟著他在廚道上磨礪了多年的廚師裡，師父也只挑了我一人來接班。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖祖輩輩傳下來的精貴手藝，豈是能隨隨便便傳人的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，不管多麼精貴的手藝，做出來的菜，總是要給人吃的啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈……我的意思是說，教出一個廚藝可以和您比肩的徒弟，真的比教出一群廚藝不錯的廚師更重要嗎……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您教的人越多，會煮飯的人也就越多，更多的大炎人才能吃到更美味的菜不是嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……歪理邪說，不知敬畏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先好好準備你的麵吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g7_zuosroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都準備就緒了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉門守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玉門已經進入最高戰備狀態，城防武器皆已就位。城中百姓全部遣散，僅餘兩萬戰士、三千天師，隨時可以奔赴戰場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉門守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只待軍令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那且看今晚這月色，到底陰晴如何吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉門守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將軍，太尉的信使到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這個時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉門守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那人沒有帶信，他只是送來了……一盒月餅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉門守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信使說，太尉有一句話要帶給將軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉門守軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“趁熱吃，不可等涼了。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_pawnshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"左公子的確看懂了在下的提示。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又見面了……左公子，別來無恙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必緊張，這家當鋪關門許久了，不會有人來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你單獨約見我，是想做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不應該反過來問左公子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年逗留百灶的時候，隨興開了這家當鋪，生意也一度興盛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每天都有客人送來各式各樣的古玩字畫、金玉奇石……結果被我那個喜歡擺弄山河的弟弟順走不少——都擺到他的園林裡去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最有趣的一點是，光顧這家當鋪的客人都有一個共同點——他們都是有求於我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你未免自視過高了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過左公子既然還願意來見在下，那不正是說明左公子也想談談？左公子心中疑問，在下或許能夠解答一二呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只在意……你們來到百灶，目的究竟是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果那個罪人決意在此時與炎國開戰，那等待他的結果只會是自取滅亡——他不會不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊……我那個哥哥，別無所長，唯獨對這縱橫之術，頗有心得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左公子可還記得，在玉門出現的那一夥山海眾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司歲台事後調查復盤，發現其中有另一隻巨獸所化的代理人行動的痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事中，望同樣有嫌疑……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左公子當然應該記得，千年前的那場圍獵，大炎領土內的數隻巨獸，要嘛被消滅，要嘛被驅逐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那司歲台是否想過，他既然能找到其中一隻……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他找到的，就僅有那一隻嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多年以來，司歲台始終警惕著他在炎國的一舉一動，是不是忘了去想，他的棋子落在炎國之外的可能性？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要小看司歲台的情報……司歲台從未中斷過對那幾隻巨獸的跟蹤觀察。那些巨獸如果有所異動，巨獸學士一定會有所察覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算算時間，他們應該已經在趕回來的路上了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這份情報，可以當作我送給左公子的一份薄禮。至於要如何使用，左公子可以自行決斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼要告訴我這件事？你既然已經與那個罪人同謀，為何要告訴司歲台他的打算？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實不相瞞……我與那個哥哥雖然是合作，可各自的心思，多少還是有些分別的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他執意要分出個勝負，我倒是覺得，和和氣氣地把生意做下去更重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於為什麼要挑選左公子……就當是我覺得，與左公子投緣吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我自詡有幾分識人的本事，直覺告訴我，將來還會有與左公子打交道的機會……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定以後，我們兄弟姐妹的生死去向，都要仰仗左公子的決斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"績","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"值此佳節，能和左公子少敘片刻，也算是緣分……希望左公子將來，也能將在下當作可以交談的“人”吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g7_forbiddencity"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗心大意的廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉喲！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"領頭的廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼搞的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗心大意的廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起！我、我剛才手抽筋了！沒拿穩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"領頭的廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真是……唉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗心大意的廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起！我這就去廚房，重新端一盤備餐出來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"領頭的廚師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"動作快點！百官都已經入席了，等真龍到場，宴會就要開始了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏的衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大人？您需要幫忙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏的衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳……我是來參加百珍宴的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏的衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與會的各位官員都已入席落座，您怎麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉……來的路上耽誤了一些時間，我這就進去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏的衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請等一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏的衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位大人，請出示一下您的百珍宴請柬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為何？我已經站在這裡，還需要向你出示請柬嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏的衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"例行檢查，還請大人見諒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大人……大人！您東西落下了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"著急的女子","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您剛剛出門走得急，怎麼把最要緊的東西落在家裡了啊。還好讓我看到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏的衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來是戶部的唐大人，多有得罪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏的衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼問題了，宴會馬上就要開始了，還請唐大人儘快入席吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請柬是我偽造的，只能騙過這一時，還請麟少卿小心行事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我認得你……你是寧府的小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是煌的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在百珍宴廚師名單上看到了煌的名字，就猜到了你們的打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的事，只能在見到真龍之後再請他寬宥了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你可知……要是這件舊案重見天日，必定殃及你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可這個舊案牽連最深的人，應該是煌才對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟少卿不是已經答應幫煌查明真相了嗎，還有什麼別的好顧忌的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何況……麟少卿若真的能讓這件事水落石出，那樣的結果，我求之不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g6_baizhenbanquet"},{"type":"narration","text":"為官數載，我也極少踏入這座禁城。\n我看到一幢幢高抵穹宇的宮殿莊嚴偉岸，屹立挺拔。\n我看到宴席繁盛無兩，高朋滿座。燈火如晝，月色入懷。\n可我看不透……\n是誰有意掩蓋那些名字，是誰不願讓真相大白？\n我忽然想起了前輩曾經說過的那句話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g6_baizhenbanquet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虞澄……你到底，看到了什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的官員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1632_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，已經是開宴的時間了，陛下怎麼還沒有到啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉穩的官員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1633_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫要著急，陛下事務繁忙，或許是被什麼要緊事牽絆住了一時半刻，我們靜候就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的官員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1632_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前聽說陛下身體有恙已經有一陣子了，難道真有此事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉穩的官員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1633_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓……別亂說話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"豈有此理！簡直豈有此理！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是什麼地方？你們有什麼道理阻攔朝廷命官？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何事喧鬧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個人說他是戶部侍郎唐儉，可是我們核對過，戶部的座席分明已經坐滿了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的戶部官員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"荒唐！什麼叫“我說我是”？你好好看看我是誰？你看我手中的官印是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"喧囂戛然而止。\n第三聲號角，夜晚戌時。\n明月當空，照得夜色清朗，容不下一絲雜色。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g6_baizhenbanquet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宣禮官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"正禮——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"百官紛紛起立，屏息凝神，目視宴席最中央的位置。\n待到那道身影出現在主位——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"臣有事要奏！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"火。\n不知從何處騰起的一簇火苗，只藉著一陣秋夜的風，襲捲了整個宴席。\n躥騰的火舌形似奇詭異獸，張牙舞爪，盤桓在宴席上空。\n又一陣風吹來，火焰異獸的身軀高高升起，迅速爆燃膨脹，並發出了令人不安的聲音，彷彿它在大聲地嘶吼著，嗤笑著——\n自它傾瀉而出的幽異火光早已浸染了百珍宴，此刻正閃動著，攀上官員們慌張的臉龐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是……怎麼回事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
